"昭公四十七年卒，子悼公購由立。悼公八年卒，子休公田立。休公田二十三年卒，子辟公辟兵立。辟公三年卒，子剔成立。剔成四十一年，剔成弟偃攻襲剔成，剔成敗奔齊，偃自立爲宋君。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-038-song:p057","quote":"君偃十一年，自立爲王。東敗齊，取五城；南敗楚，取地三百里；西敗魏軍，乃與齊、魏爲敵國。盛血以韋囊，縣而射之，命曰「射天」。淫於酒婦人。羣臣諫者輒射之。於是諸矦皆曰「桀宋」，「宋其復爲紂所爲，不可不誅。」告齊伐宋。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-038-song:p058","quote":"王偃立四十七年，齊湣王與魏、楚伐宋，殺王偃，遂滅宋而三分其地。"}],"rationale":"按本篇明示名與稱號、宋國世系及具體事件暫同指；未把同字短名全域合併，所有引句與未定處保留。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:p056","text":"昭公四十七年卒，子悼公購由立。悼公八年卒，子休公田立。休公田二十三年卒，子辟公辟兵立。辟公三年卒，子剔成立。剔成四十一年，剔成弟偃攻襲剔成，剔成敗奔齊，偃自立爲宋君。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m056-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"昭公","kind":"person","person_id":"rex_cs0_mfo_AAABAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m056-0009","start":9,"end":13,"surface":"悼公購由","kind":"person","person_id":"rex_cs0_mfo_AAABAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m056-0015","start":15,"end":17,"surface":"悼公","kind":"person","person_id":"rex_cs0_mfo_AAABAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m056-0022","start":22,"end":25,"surface":"休公田","kind":"person","person_id":"rex_cs0_mfo_AAABAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m056-0027","start":27,"end":30,"surface":"休公田","kind":"person","person_id":"rex_cs0_mfo_AAABAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m056-0037","start":37,"end":41,"surface":"辟公辟兵","kind":"person","person_id":"rex_cs0_mfo_AAABAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m056-0043","start":43,"end":45,"surface":"辟公","kind":"person","person_id":"rex_cs0_mfo_AAABAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m056-0050","start":50,"end":52,"surface":"剔成","kind":"person","person_id":"rex_cs0_mfo_AAABAAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m056-0054","start":54,"end":56,"surface":"剔成","kind":"